# Commits and changelog

Follow [Keep a Changelog 1.1.0](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.1.0/) in `CHANGELOG.md`.

- On each commit with user-facing changes, add bullets under `## [Unreleased]` in `### Added`, `### Changed`, `### Fixed`, `### Removed`, or `### Security`.
- Style: **bold** lead-in, then detail; use backticks for function names, hooks, filters, and paths.
- Include `CHANGELOG.md` in the same commit as the related code.
- Every shipped version section (`## [x.y.z] - YYYY-MM-DD`) has a one-sentence plain-language summary after the heading, before the first `###` subsection.
- Do not add a summary under `## [Unreleased]`.
